            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1597,
                "endIndex": 1843,
                "text": "*   **Editing Tools:** Offers basic editing capabilities like trimming and caption adjustments, with more advanced features like AI B-roll and export to professional editing software (Adobe Premiere Pro, DaVinci Resolve) available in higher tiers"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
